    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been my intellectual grounding—though not without friction. While I love its precision and logical rigor, it’s a subject that demands discipline, especially since my openness score suggests I sometimes prefer creative problem-solving over abstract algebra. My PhD in computer science meant I had to navigate its complexity daily, but it taught me patience; now, I see its patterns like a puzzle worth solving slowly.",
